{"verse_key": "14:44", "surah": 14, "verse": 44, "text_uthmani": "وَأَنذِرِ ٱلنَّاسَ يَوْمَ يَأْتِيهِمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ فَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ أَخِّرْنَآ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ قَرِيبٍ نُّجِبْ دَعْوَتَكَ وَنَتَّبِعِ ٱلرُّسُلَ ۗ أَوَلَمْ تَكُونُوٓا۟ أَقْسَمْتُم مِّن قَبْلُ مَا لَكُم مِّن زَوَالٍ", "translation": "And, [O Muḥammad], warn the people of a Day when the punishment will come to them and those who did wrong will say, \"Our Lord, delay us for a short term; we will answer Your call and follow the messengers.\" [But it will be said], \"Had you not sworn, before, that for you there would be no cessation?<sup foot_note=196580>1</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 933480, "verse_to_ms": 950560, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَأَنذِرِ", "start_ms": 933480, "end_ms": 935410}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "start_ms": 935410, "end_ms": 936140}, {"i": 2, "text": "يَوْمَ", "start_ms": 936140, "end_ms": 937090}, {"i": 3, "text": "يَأْتِيهِمُ", "start_ms": 937090, "end_ms": 937940}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلْعَذَابُ", "start_ms": 937940, "end_ms": 939710}, {"i": 5, "text": "فَيَقُولُ", "start_ms": 939710, "end_ms": 940720}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 940720, "end_ms": 944450}, {"i": 7, "text": "ظَلَمُوا۟", "start_ms": 944450, "end_ms": 945410}, {"i": 8, "text": "رَبَّنَآ", "start_ms": 945410, "end_ms": 946530}, {"i": 9, "text": "أَخِّرْنَآ", "start_ms": 946530, "end_ms": 947060}, {"i": 10, "text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "start_ms": 947060, "end_ms": 947660}, {"i": 11, "text": "أَجَلٍ", "start_ms": 947660, "end_ms": 950425}, {"i": 12, "text": "قَرِيبٍ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 13, "text": "نُّجِبْ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 14, "text": "دَعْوَتَكَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَنَتَّبِعِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلرُّسُلَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms